          <p class="brx-label">Warning signs on the boiler</p>
          <ul class="brx-list">
            <li>A lazy yellow or orange flame instead of a crisp blue one</li>
            <li>Black soot or brown staining on or around the boiler</li>
            <li>A pilot light that keeps going out</li>
            <li>More condensation than usual on windows near it</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="brx-label">Carbon monoxide symptoms</p>
          <ul class="brx-list">
            <li>Headaches, dizziness or feeling sick</li>
            <li>Tiredness, breathlessness or confusion</li>
            <li>Symptoms that ease when you leave the house</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
