      </div>
      <p>Fit an audible carbon monoxide alarm in every room with a gas appliance, and test it monthly. Before anyone works on your boiler, check they are on the Gas Safe Register and ask to see their Gas Safe ID card. Landlords need a <a class="brx-link" href="/gas-safety-certificate-liverpool">gas safety certificate (CP12)</a> every year.</p>
